body='''<section class="editorial-hero wrap"><div class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</div><h1>Experience behind us.<br><em>Possibility ahead.</em></h1><p>We’re building a more resilient IT ecosystem for India’s SMEs—where better infrastructure supports stronger businesses.</p></section><section class="detail-section wrap two-columns"><h2>The SME deserves<br><span>a stronger foundation.</span></h2><div class="prose"><p>ITCraft stands at the intersection of technology and entrepreneurship. We help businesses improve continuity, efficiency and security by connecting infrastructure assessment, implementation and ongoing management.</p><p>Built on IITPL’s 20+ years of experience, our approach combines technical expertise with an understanding of the realities of growing businesses.</p><p>Through our Authorised Tech Partner network, we aim to bring this support to Tier 1, Tier 2 and Tier 3 cities across India.</p></div></section><section class="light-section"><div class="wrap detail-section mission-grid"><article><div class="eyebrow">OUR MISSION</div><h2>Start with<br>10,000 SMEs.</h2><p>Assess, design, guide, implement, secure and manage their IT ecosystems as the first step towards wider impact.</p></article><article><div class="eyebrow">OUR VISION</div><h2>Enable<br>100,000 SMEs.</h2><p>Build business continuity and efficiency through scalable technology, committed local partners and long-term support.</p></article></div></section><section class="detail-section wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND ITCRAFT</div><h2>Expertise.<br><span>With a shared purpose.</span></h2><div class="team-grid">'''+''.join(f'<article><div class="initials">{"".join(x[0] for x in n.split()[:2])}</div><h3>{n}</h3><span>{r}</span><p>{d}</p></article>' for n,r,d in team)+'''</div></section>'''+contact_cta('Build your next chapter with us.')
