body='''<section class="editorial-hero wrap"><div class="eyebrow">AUTHORISED TECH PARTNERS</div><h1>Your network.<br><em>A bigger opportunity.</em></h1><p>Help SMEs in your community build secure, resilient IT. Combine your relationships with ITCraft’s assessment, delivery and managed-service expertise.</p><a class="button primary" href="mailto:info@itcraft.net.in?subject=Authorised%20Tech%20Partner%20enquiry">Become a partner ↗</a></section><section class="detail-section wrap two-columns"><h2>Local connections.<br><span>National ambition.</span></h2><div class="prose"><p>India’s growing SMEs need dependable infrastructure, better security and practical guidance. Many do not have the in-house expertise to identify and address their IT gaps.</p><p>Our Authorised Tech Partner model connects those businesses with ITCraft’s technology and delivery capabilities, supporting digital adoption across Tier 1, Tier 2 and Tier 3 cities.</p></div></section><section class="light-section"><div class="wrap detail-section"><div class="eyebrow">THE PARTNER ADVANTAGE</div><h2>Build relationships.<br><span>Create lasting value.</span></h2>'''+cards([('An additional revenue stream','Introduce relevant services to businesses already in your network.'),('8.6% conversion commission','The current programme advertises commission on successful conversions. Commercial terms are confirmed during onboarding.'),('Recognition for your efforts','The programme includes a digital reward mechanism for partner activity, including leads that do not convert, subject to programme terms.'),('Technical delivery support','ITCraft handles assessment, solution design, implementation and managed-service expertise.'),('No upfront investment','The programme is presented as an opportunity to generate revenue without an upfront investment.'),('A shared SME mission','Help businesses improve resilience and productivity while growing a sustainable local network.')])+'''</div></section><section class="detail-section wrap"><div class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK TOGETHER</div><h2>One connection.<br><span>A complete journey.</span></h2>'''+workflow([('Connect','Introduce an SME and schedule an initial conversation with ITCraft.'),('Assess','Our experts review the customer’s infrastructure and security posture.'),('Onboard','Agree the solution and build the technology foundation for continuity and productivity.'),('Support','Provide ongoing monitoring, technical support and managed services.')])+'''</section>'''+contact_cta('Let’s grow the SME ecosystem.','Authorised Tech Partner enquiry')
